==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (1,000%) spawn, delay 3~5 seconds<sup>90f~150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (1,000%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~7 seconds<sup>150f~210f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**8 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>.
**5 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (1,000%) spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The gimmick of the [[Seeing Red Stages]] is that it will only send [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies, so the best units to bring are [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] cats, such as [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]], [[Whale Cat]], etc.

